  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the addition of the new menu backgrounds for VRC+ users it would be nice if we could get the option to change the color of the text/foreground/background of all UI menus. As some have pointed out, the existing backgrounds can cause issues with the current icon colors, and while simply changing the icon colors to match with the backgrounds would be a good fix. Introducing a system that lets the user change the colors however they want would be better for both visibility and fun.",
